  "content": "[Intro]\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]The\ntime has come again\nSlowly walking\n[Dm]down the steps\n[C]To\nwhere she would have\nbeen\nIf\nonly they were\n[Dm]seventeen\n\n[Verse 1]\n[C]\nWaiting patien-\ntly\nAnd\nstood between a\n[Dm]fraying seam\n[C]\nHiding from him-\nself\nAs\nwell as every-\n[Dm]body else\n[C]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Dm]Without per-\nmission, his\n[C]face became wet\nHe\n[Dm]thought that he'd\nlearnt how to not\n[C]get upset\nFrom\n[Dm]folded notes in\nenvelopes \"Meet\n[C]me beneath the moon,\n[A]don't go too\n[Dm]soon\"\nShe went too\n[G]soon\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]The\ntime has come again\nSlowly walking\n[Dm]down the steps\n[C]To\nwhere she would have\nbeen\nIf\nonly they were\n[Dm]seventeen\n[C]",
